meta {
  name: Benefit Management System
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Benefit Management System

  Local collection for the FastAPI app in this repository.

  ## Getting started

  1. Start the API with `uv run dev`.
  2. Open this folder in Bruno (`Collection` → `Open Collection`).
  3. Select the `Local` environment.
  4. Run **Auth → Get Token** first. It stores the JWT in the `token`
     environment variable, which every other request sends as a bearer token.

  The in-memory store starts with one department (`Recursos Humanos`).
  The default credentials are `admin` / `admin`.
}
